  "name": "dolma3_dolmino_pool",
  "description": "\u26a0\ufe0f IMPORTANT NOTICE \u26a0\ufe0f\nThis is the Dolma 3 Dolmino pool; it hasn't been mixed. \nIf you are interested in the data used to train: \n\nOlmo 3 7B: allenai/dolma3_dolmino_mix-100B-1025\nOlmo 3 32B: allenai/dolma3_dolmino_mix-100B-1125\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDolma 3 Dolmino dataset pool for Olmo 3 stage 2 annealing training\n\t\n\nThis dataset contains the high-quality pool of data considered for the second stage of Olmo 3 7B. \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Sources\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nSource\nCategory\nTokens\nDocuments\n\n\n\t\t\nTinyMATH Mind\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/allenai/dolma3_dolmino_pool.",
